        "eng": "Princess Be Careful",
        "jpn": "姫様ご用心"
    },
    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "Himeko Tsubaki is a xenophobic schoolgirl in a tennis club who, thanks to a couple of bumbling foreign thieves, accidentally comes into the possession of a magic crown that turns her into a princess Unfortunately, this crown makes her a target for the thieves, a nonsense-speaking little foreign girl, a cat-obsessed cult, a love-struck assassin, a bomb-happy little foreign prince - and even a pink cat king from another world. Of course, hijinx and hilarity cannot help ensuing.",
        "jpn": "椿姫子はテニス部の外国人嫌いの女子高生で、外国人泥棒のせいで偶然魔法の王冠を手に入れて王女になってしまう残念ながら、この王冠は彼女を泥棒の標的にしている、ナンセンス-話す小さな外国人の女の子、猫に夢中のカルト、恋に落ちた暗殺者、爆弾幸せな小さな外国人の王子-そして別の世界からのピンクの猫の王さえ。もちろん、hijinxと陽気さはその後に続くのを助けることはできません。"
    },
    "Aliases": [
        "Hime-sama Goyojin",
        "Hime-sama Goyōjin"
    ],
